The markdown renderer in this directory began as the svelte-streamdown
package (https://github.com/beynar/svelte-streamdown), baseline 3.1.2,
licensed below. `render/` and `parser/extensions/` descend from it, heavily
modified: dead features removed, the theme flattened into the app's token
layer, and the parser reworked for incremental streaming.

Original to agent-overflow, sharing no upstream lineage: the incremental
lexing and block-parsing path (`parser/parseBlocks.ts`,
`parser/parseBlocks.cache.ts`, `parser/geometry.ts`,
`parser/incrementalLex*.ts` and `parser/provenAppend.ts` — the
`ProvenAppend` brand and the trailing-block descent records included),
`render/literalHost.ts` + `LiteralHost.svelte`,
`render/CompactBlocks.svelte`, `render/staticHtml.ts`,
`render/documentInteraction.ts`, `render/paragraphSpacing.ts`, and every
test beside this tree.

`boundary/` carries its own LICENSE (incremark) and is unrelated to the
notice below.

The parser still calls into the `marked` package, which is an external
dependency at this point rather than code in this directory; when that
lexer path is absorbed here (campaign wave W4) its MIT notice — MarkedJS
contributors 2018-2025, Christopher Jeffrey 2011-2018 — is appended below.

